menu "Gateway: board (Waveshare ESP32-S3-POE-ETH-8DI-8DO)"

    config GW_DI_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "DI inputs are active low"
        default y
        help
            Waveshare's demo configures GPIO4-11 with pull-ups and ESPHome marks them
            inverted: an energised input pulls the GPIO low. The internal pull-ups are
            enabled only for active-low inputs.

    config GW_DO_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "DO outputs are active low (LOW expander pin = output on)"
        default y
        help
            Waveshare's demo loads 0xFF into the TCA9554 at boot and mirrors the raw DI
            levels onto the DOs, and ESPHome declares the 8 outputs inverted: a LOW pin
            energises the output. The latch is loaded with the OFF level of every
            channel before the pins become outputs. Verify on the board before use.

endmenu
